00:01:13.507 --> 00:01:16.185
Shoujun au shikin kyori de break

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.888
Big shooter ikiisoide blazing

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.491
Beat you up kirihiraite break

00:01:21.515 --> 00:01:24.127
Shot shooter ikiisoida crazy

00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:27.052
Shoujun au shikin kyori de break

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:31.083
One dead.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:08.398
This can't be happening...

00:03:08.422 --> 00:03:10.584
What do I do?

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.829
"Pedestrians and Bicyclists only”

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:25.805
"Yuzo?"

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.654
What do I do?

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.806
What am I supposed to do?

00:03:38.285 --> 00:03:38.428
"Please wait for the light.”

00:03:38.452 --> 00:03:40.463
"Please wait for the light.”
Don't come! Don't come this way!

00:03:40.487 --> 00:03:40.897
Don't come! Don't come this way!

00:03:40.921 --> 00:03:42.098
Change!

00:03:42.122 --> 00:03:44.887
Light, come on, change!

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:52.408
Get a grip, Kei.

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:54.958
You know this won't stop that damn thing!

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:01.368
It... it stopped. All right...

00:04:04.678 --> 00:04:08.012
Hey, don't ignore the lights!

00:04:17.624 --> 00:04:21.437
Kishimoto, I'm gonna die.

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:23.486
This is it}

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:27.777
What the hell is this thing?

00:04:27.801 --> 00:04:30.413
He's freaking me out!

00:04:30.437 --> 00:04:31.881
Huh?

00:04:31.905 --> 00:04:33.216
What happened?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:36.652
Could it be that he can't see me?

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:40.122
Then maybe I can get him. If it's from behind...

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:43.138
Do I do it? Could I get him?

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:49.232
I can end it right here, right now.

00:04:49.256 --> 00:04:52.768
The thing's just arobot,
no matter how you look at it!

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:56.092
If it's only arobot... If it's only arobot...

00:04:59.199 --> 00:05:00.543
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:05:00.567 --> 00:05:03.813
Bones? He's got bones!

00:05:03.837 --> 00:05:06.949
Now what? This thing must be alive!

00:05:06.973 --> 00:05:08.484
What do I do now?

00:05:08.508 --> 00:05:11.273
I've never killed anything this big before.

00:05:13.547 --> 00:05:15.811
There's just something wrong with that kid!

00:05:17.384 --> 00:05:19.216
Damn it, I can't do this.

00:05:24.925 --> 00:05:26.402
Yuzo?

00:05:26.426 --> 00:05:28.104
Huh?

00:05:28.128 --> 00:05:29.994
Yuzo?

00:05:38.238 --> 00:05:40.316
Yuzo...

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.817
I'm not Yuzo.

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:44.387
Kantaro, yeah!

00:05:44.411 --> 00:05:45.922
What?

00:05:45.946 --> 00:05:49.541
Kantaro! Okay, all together now!

00:06:08.702 --> 00:06:10.546
Where are we?

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.849
Yes, we did it! We're outside, Grandma!

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:15.184
You're right.

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:17.386
I guess we can go home now.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.322
Wait a minute, please!

00:06:19.346 --> 00:06:21.857
Everyone, please come over here.

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:24.360
Hey, I'm outta here, dumb-ass!

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:26.696
He's mumbling something.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:28.381
Stop right there.

00:06:29.456 --> 00:06:30.466
Huh?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:34.070
You planning to just leave
Kosuke's body there like that?

00:06:34.094 --> 00:06:36.005
So go dig him a grave or something.

00:06:36.029 --> 00:06:37.929
You think I give a shit?

00:06:43.837 --> 00:06:46.582
Anyway, I gotta run.

00:06:46.606 --> 00:06:48.574
I have to go where everyone is.

00:06:55.849 --> 00:06:58.011
Kantaro!

00:07:00.654 --> 00:07:02.486
Kato!

00:07:05.892 --> 00:07:07.637
It's Kei.

00:07:07.661 --> 00:07:09.789
Hey, isn't that...?

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:16.779
Is that it? The whatever-alien...

00:07:16.803 --> 00:07:18.648
Yeah, that's it.

00:07:18.672 --> 00:07:20.049
What the hell's that thing supposed to be?

00:07:20.073 --> 00:07:22.618
Kinji, wanna stick around a little longer?

00:07:22.642 --> 00:07:24.854
This looks like it could get interesting.

00:07:24.878 --> 00:07:27.823
Grandma! That's a robot!

00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.941
That's a pretty good robot.

00:07:38.158 --> 00:07:39.468
Kurono...

00:07:39.492 --> 00:07:43.539
Sweet! She was worried about me!

00:07:43.563 --> 00:07:45.341
So you couldn't get rid of him?

00:07:45.365 --> 00:07:47.276
Is that all she cares about?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.200
Stay back, everyone!

00:07:54.774 --> 00:07:56.765
He doesn't look angry anymore.

00:08:03.483 --> 00:08:05.361
Well, what do we do now, Kato?

00:08:05.385 --> 00:08:09.565
Will you look at this crap?
What the hell kind of alien is that?

00:08:09.589 --> 00:08:13.135
You know, even motorcycle companies
are making robots these days.

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.004
I'll bet that thing's one of 'em!

00:08:15.028 --> 00:08:16.505
Canlgo now?

00:08:16.529 --> 00:08:18.741
Whoa, hold on.

00:08:18.765 --> 00:08:21.243
Don't go just yet.

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:24.780
Kei, is this thing dangerous or what?

00:08:24.804 --> 00:08:26.716
I dunno.

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.052
But if you remember that Greenonion Alien...

00:08:30.076 --> 00:08:31.721
Greenonion Alien?

00:08:31.745 --> 00:08:32.855
Huh?

00:08:32.879 --> 00:08:35.558
What, you fought a green onion before Yoshida?

00:08:35.582 --> 00:08:37.359
What kinda bullshit is that?

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:39.895
It's Suzuki! This is the Suzuki Alien!

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:42.598
--So what are you saying?
--Well...

00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:44.333
You remember how when Gantz
introduced the Greenonion Alien to us,

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:46.502
"The Greenonion Alien Traits: Strong, 2maslly Likes: Green oniongz,
friendship” You remember how when Gantz introduced the Greenonion Alien to us,

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:46.702
"The Greenonion Alien Traits: Strong, 2maslly Likes: Green
oniongz, friendship” it showed us the wimpy little one?

00:08:46.726 --> 00:08:49.705
It showed us the wimpy little one?

00:08:49.729 --> 00:08:51.288
But then...

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:56.946
So maybe there could be
another strong one like him.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.581
Cl
mon, man!

00:08:58.605 --> 00:09:02.451
Can't you even make up your damn minds
about kicking this stupid robot's ass?

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:04.954
Jeez, you two got some serious problems.

00:09:04.978 --> 00:09:07.590
Kinji, let's get out of here. I'm hungry.

00:09:07.614 --> 00:09:10.549
--Yeah, why don't we go get some ramen?
--Good call.

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:17.566
I'll be damned if you're coming along with us!

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.568
Ryota, do you wanna go now?

00:09:19.592 --> 00:09:22.905
No way! This robot looks cool.

00:09:22.929 --> 00:09:24.807
Oh, dear...

00:09:24.831 --> 00:09:28.310
But we have to get you
back to your mother soon.

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:32.134
I wonder if there's a payphone nearby?

00:09:55.628 --> 00:09:57.807
Damn!

00:09:57.831 --> 00:09:59.074
That little shit...

00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:02.511
So you've been hiding again, huh?

00:10:02.535 --> 00:10:03.546
You little coward!

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:06.749
Ah, shut up. Now get outta the way!

00:10:06.773 --> 00:10:10.219
Hey, don't hide behind me!

00:10:10.243 --> 00:10:14.523
What am I supposed to do?
I'm not wearing a suit or anything!

00:10:14.547 --> 00:10:18.360
Aren't you always hiding behind Kato, anyway?

00:10:18.384 --> 00:10:20.930
Ten more points...

00:10:20.954 --> 00:10:22.922
Ten more points...!

00:10:26.359 --> 00:10:28.225
Don't do it, Nishi!

00:10:38.104 --> 00:10:40.516
Whoa! The thing can fly!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.952
How did it do that?

00:10:42.976 --> 00:10:45.968
This is starting to look really bad.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:50.960
Grandma! Look! It's flying!

00:10:50.984 --> 00:10:53.078
Can I go home now?

00:11:09.769 --> 00:11:11.480
Yeah, whatever...

00:11:11.504 --> 00:11:13.349
Come on!

00:11:13.373 --> 00:11:14.884
He disappeared!

00:11:14.908 --> 00:11:17.206
I think I'm gonna stay a little longer.

00:11:49.876 --> 00:11:52.106
Okay, all together!

00:12:02.422 --> 00:12:05.367
What the hell is that robot doing?!

00:12:05.391 --> 00:12:08.203
That was Nishi just now, wasn't it?

00:12:08.227 --> 00:12:09.638
I think so...

00:12:09.662 --> 00:12:12.154
Seems that robot can see him after all.

00:12:14.767 --> 00:12:15.911
Grandma!

00:12:15.935 --> 00:12:19.394
Look at all that stuff it destroyed! Wow!

00:12:34.787 --> 00:12:37.733
It saw him that time, didn't it?

00:12:37.757 --> 00:12:40.669
--Yeah...
--Look, Grandma!

00:12:40.693 --> 00:12:44.039
That guy can disappear, too! That's so cool!

00:12:44.063 --> 00:12:46.375
--Uh, yeah...
--That little shit!

00:12:46.399 --> 00:12:48.744
How come he can do stuff like that?!

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:50.145
I don't know!

00:12:50.169 --> 00:12:51.981
Why don't you ask Gantz?

00:12:52.005 --> 00:12:54.717
Gantz? What the hell is that?

00:12:54.741 --> 00:12:56.652
We don't really know.

00:12:56.676 --> 00:12:58.838
It's one annoying son of a bitch, though.

00:13:02.115 --> 00:13:03.947
Damn!

00:13:17.397 --> 00:13:18.540
What the fuck?!

00:13:18.564 --> 00:13:20.676
He ain't disappearing no more!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:24.864
C'mon, kid! Do your little trick again!

00:13:35.982 --> 00:13:38.060
Ten more points...

00:13:38.084 --> 00:13:40.348
Ten more points, damn it!

00:13:43.456 --> 00:13:46.187
Stop running away! Just give up!

00:13:55.802 --> 00:13:57.600
Shit!

00:14:01.374 --> 00:14:06.321
Hey, do you think that thing is broken?
He stopped disappearing.

00:14:06.345 --> 00:14:10.626
That thing could see him anyway,
so it makes no difference!

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.982
Kei, you might be right, but still...

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.220
To hell with that little shit!

00:14:20.693 --> 00:14:22.638
Hey, what are you all gawking at?

00:14:22.662 --> 00:14:24.807
Help me out here!

00:14:24.831 --> 00:14:27.109
Hey, did you hear that, Haruya?

00:14:27.133 --> 00:14:30.446
Heh, who's the one that doesn't get it now?

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:31.814
You can go to Hell!

00:14:31.838 --> 00:14:34.550
You're the one who called us
garbage before! Remember?

00:14:34.574 --> 00:14:37.986
So do you beg garbage for
help when things get bad?

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:43.759
We'd love to help you, but we can't,
since we're garbage and all. Get it?

00:14:43.783 --> 00:14:45.649
Yeah, ya get it?

00:14:52.358 --> 00:14:55.604
Whoo boy! Your peashooter's gone!

00:14:55.628 --> 00:14:59.030
Now what are you gonna do, ya little shit?

00:15:00.032 --> 00:15:02.077
Just shut up and help me now!

00:15:02.101 --> 00:15:03.579
Don't give me that crap!

00:15:03.603 --> 00:15:05.914
After all the shit you gave us earlier!

00:15:05.938 --> 00:15:08.684
You can just stay there
and fucking die! Die! Die!!

00:15:08.708 --> 00:15:10.185
Give me a break!

00:15:10.209 --> 00:15:15.090
You told us we're all dead anyway, right?
So what difference does it make?

00:15:15.114 --> 00:15:19.394
You can just keep on dying
and dying, right? Huh?

00:15:19.418 --> 00:15:21.763
Haruya, that's enough.

00:15:21.787 --> 00:15:24.313
Shut up. You stay out of...

00:15:26.859 --> 00:15:29.238
My fuckin' tooth!

00:15:29.262 --> 00:15:32.040
Tetsu, what the hell did you do that for?

00:15:32.064 --> 00:15:36.545
Thugs certainly love
knocking each other's teeth out.

00:15:36.569 --> 00:15:40.582
Hey, kid! Looks like this isn't just a game, is it?

00:15:40.606 --> 00:15:43.685
I get the idea you're in
a lot of trouble right now.

00:15:43.709 --> 00:15:47.656
But you still did blow Kosuke's head off!

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.359
I hope you didn't forget about that!

00:15:50.383 --> 00:15:53.262
You murdered another person!

00:15:53.286 --> 00:15:56.085
Tell us something to show that you're sorry!

00:15:57.156 --> 00:16:01.270
There's nothing more disgusting than
a murderer beggin' for his own life!

00:16:01.294 --> 00:16:03.372
You hear me?

00:16:03.396 --> 00:16:04.606
Well, say something!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:08.010
You gonna apologize for blowing
Kosuke's head off or not?

00:16:08.034 --> 00:16:13.282
Are you going to show any remorse at all? Well?

00:16:13.306 --> 00:16:15.651
--Wait!
--What?!

00:16:15.675 --> 00:16:19.588
Are you gonna help the little
shit if he does apologize?

00:16:19.612 --> 00:16:21.523
What the hell are you saying?

00:16:21.547 --> 00:16:22.925
Kurono?

00:16:22.949 --> 00:16:24.459
Kei...

00:16:24.483 --> 00:16:28.697
He's just trying to save his own ass.

00:16:28.721 --> 00:16:33.135
The only thing he's ever cared
about is his damned score.

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:36.959
Are you willing to help a guy like that?

00:16:38.664 --> 00:16:41.143
This is about taking moral responsibility.

00:16:41.167 --> 00:16:45.035
I'm not like your frickin' indecisive leader.

00:16:47.673 --> 00:16:49.402
Do any of you...

00:16:54.347 --> 00:16:58.409
...understand the preciousness of life?

00:17:03.189 --> 00:17:05.214
Do you?

00:17:07.293 --> 00:17:13.995
I'm not saying I completely believe him.
But at this rate, that kid's gonna die.

00:17:16.202 --> 00:17:18.933
So what are you going to do? Well?

00:17:29.782 --> 00:17:31.193
Don't get me wrong.

00:17:31.217 --> 00:17:35.620
That doesn't mean that I'm going
to save murderers so easily, either.

00:17:36.922 --> 00:17:40.483
But I might consider it, only if he apologizes.

00:17:42.895 --> 00:17:47.576
He's treated all of us like shit. I'm no exception.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:54.516
But I don't really mind helping him,
so long as he apologizes.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.736
What about you three?

00:18:29.375 --> 00:18:33.722
Somebody! Help! Help me!

00:18:33.746 --> 00:18:35.290
Help me!

00:18:35.314 --> 00:18:37.159
What the...?

00:18:37.183 --> 00:18:38.860
What's happening to him?

00:18:38.884 --> 00:18:42.582
My suit... My suit is no good now!

00:18:43.656 --> 00:18:47.569
Hey, Grandma, what's wrong with him?

00:18:47.593 --> 00:18:48.837
Don't look.

00:18:48.861 --> 00:18:50.372
Huh? Why?

00:18:50.396 --> 00:18:52.941
Because he might die again.

00:18:52.965 --> 00:18:54.576
What do you mean?

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:58.161
Goddammit, apologize!
Listen to me, you little shit!

00:19:06.479 --> 00:19:08.880
Well, how about it?

00:19:10.216 --> 00:19:13.628
If anyone points a gun at me...

00:19:13.652 --> 00:19:15.497
...I'll Kill "em!

00:19:15.521 --> 00:19:17.666
I will never apologize!

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:20.921
That son of a bitch...

00:19:31.203 --> 00:19:32.948
Help...

00:19:32.972 --> 00:19:35.450
Somebody help me... Help...

00:19:35.474 --> 00:19:38.068
Why can't you just say you're sorry?

00:19:41.313 --> 00:19:43.925
--Kato!
--Kato...

00:19:43.949 --> 00:19:47.112
I don't know much about life, but...

00:19:54.059 --> 00:19:56.371
Look, we're all going to go back together.

00:19:56.395 --> 00:19:59.274
He can apologize anytime!

00:19:59.298 --> 00:20:03.098
Kei, tell me how to use this suit.

00:20:04.437 --> 00:20:08.350
If he dies, nobody will be able
to tell us what's going on!

00:20:08.374 --> 00:20:09.551
What the hell?!

00:20:09.575 --> 00:20:11.907
You're gonna help that son of a bitch?

00:20:13.379 --> 00:20:15.123
Kato, you can't do it!

00:20:15.147 --> 00:20:17.359
Even Nishi's on the verge of getting killed!

00:20:17.383 --> 00:20:21.329
Kato, I don't think this is a good idea.

00:20:21.353 --> 00:20:22.764
How do I use this?

00:20:22.788 --> 00:20:27.369
Well, you should be okay
as long as you focus, but...

00:20:27.393 --> 00:20:30.005
Thanks.

00:20:30.029 --> 00:20:32.396
You know what, Kei?

00:20:36.836 --> 00:20:38.847
What?

00:20:38.871 --> 00:20:41.033
The one who wants to go home the most...

00:20:42.041 --> 00:20:43.873
...is me.

00:21:06.966 --> 00:21:14.100
Hajimari wa dare demo junshin muku na baby

00:21:18.577 --> 00:21:25.608
Nigai mi kajitte mo
kujikecha dame yo walk straight

00:21:30.155 --> 00:21:38.155
Satta koto da kedo
ame no naka zukizuki itamu yo

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:46.515
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:21:46.539 --> 00:21:51.353
Yaseta yubi ni kiss o shite

00:21:51.377 --> 00:21:58.059
Naita anata o omoidasu yo

00:21:58.083 --> 00:22:02.931
Kore de owari da to shite mo

00:22:02.955 --> 00:22:07.836
Saigo no kiss wa wasurenai yo

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:15.860
Wasurenai yo... Wasurenai yo...

00:22:19.772 --> 00:22:27.772
Kare no kiss o wasurenai yo

00:22:38.090 --> 00:22:40.969
Grandma, what's that guy doing?

